## 5. Attendee Setup: Terminal `gcloud` & Application Default Credentials (ADC)

To deploy cloud resources (Cloud Run, Cloud Storage) from the terminal, build scripts, or agent tools:

```bash
# 1. Set your assigned team project ID
PROJECT_ID="{{ first_project_id }}"   # Replace with your assigned team project (e.g. {{ first_project_id }} .. {{ last_project_id }})

# 2. Authenticate gcloud CLI and Application Default Credentials (ADC) in a single browser login
gcloud auth login --update-adc

# 3. Set default project and ADC quota project to your assigned team project
gcloud config set project "${PROJECT_ID}"
gcloud auth application-default set-quota-project "${PROJECT_ID}"

# 4. Set default compute region for Cloud Run
gcloud config set compute/region {{ config.compute_region }}
```

